  "description": "A good Samaritan decides to help a fellow man after hearing a scream in the apartment garbage chute.\n\nThings don't seem the same as they used to in the hallways though...\n\nHollow Head: Director's Cut is a first person horror adventure game with PS1-style graphics. Experience a dark, intensely oppressive atmosphere and theme - not just a jump scare maze, this one may stick with you after playing.\n\nLovingly made for a \"Haunted PS1\" Game Jam, now being re-released as a director's cut with new content, lore, and challenges.\n\nEstimated play time: 30 - 90 minutes, or more\n\nNOTE: progress is saved automatically. Starting a new game will erase an existing game file.",
